    <h1>About Wailea Art</h1>
    <p class="lede">Wailea Art is a family-run studio of artists and designers, based in Maui, Hawaii.</p>

    <p>Picture it: your own gallery, gift shop, or boutique, walls lined with art your customers stop to admire, photograph, and take home. That's exactly what Wailea Art makes possible. Whether you're dressing a single feature wall or curating an entire retail display, our Hawaii-inspired prints are designed to be the piece people remember — and come back for.</p>

    <p>Before Wailea Art, our family spent years working as creative directors for major Hollywood studios, leading advertising and design campaigns for feature film posters and billboards seen across the country. That same eye for composition, color, and bold visual storytelling is what now goes into every piece we create — just pointed at a different subject: the light, color, and spirit of the Hawaiian islands.</p>

    <p>Each piece begins as an original work, built using a combination of digital media — Adobe Photoshop and Adobe Illustrator — and hand-drawn illustration, then reproduced as a museum-quality print. Our art draws on the colors and energy of Hawaii, from the resort coastline of Wailea and Kapalua, to the historic streets of Lahaina, to the energy of Honolulu and Oahu.</p>

    <p>All of our work is <strong>open edition</strong>, not limited edition — meaning a piece you love today will still be available tomorrow, and we're never trying to create artificial scarcity around our art.</p>

    <p>Every piece can also be <strong>custom sized to fit any wall</strong>. If you have a specific space in mind, send us your wall's dimensions and layout details through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, and we'll size the print to fit.</p>

    <p>Prints are available individually, or in bulk for shops, boutiques, vacation rentals, and gift retailers across Maui, Oahu, Kauai, and the Big Island looking for authentic, professionally designed Hawaii-inspired wall art at wholesale pricing.</p>

    <p>Every retail order and packaged bulk order ships with a protective plastic sleeve, a support backing board, and a white card envelope, so your print arrives ready to frame.</p>

    <p>Have a question about a piece, a custom size, or wholesale pricing for your Hawaii-based shop or business? Get in touch on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
